id: R05
target: src/sello/ristretto.nim
desc: ristrettoDecode: y=0 reject term inverted, 'yZero' -> '(not yZero)' in the verdict combine -- rejects every nonzero-y point (essentially everything) and accepts only y=0, the opposite of RFC 9496 §4.3.1's final reject condition. RFC-004 slice 8b.
====OLD====
  if (not canonical) or sNegative or (not wasSquare) or tNegative or yZero:
====NEW====
  if (not canonical) or sNegative or (not wasSquare) or tNegative or (not yZero):
====END====
